            <h1 class="article-title">From alert queues to agentic defense: protecting utility-infrastructure mapping systems</h1>
            <p class="article-summary">
                How Tabiri helped CDP-MapSync evolve monitoring for proprietary GPS and GIS workflows—from endpoint telemetry and engineer-led investigation to a human-governed Agentic SecOps architecture supporting engineering and utility operations.
            </p>
            <div class="article-author">
